# Every scheduled task in Get-ScheduledTask's order, and every detail of the
# tasks tools/windows-state.ps1 registers (D80, SPEC-QUESTIONS T3-2): folders,
# never run, disabled, hidden, ran, failed, running, a trigger in the future
# and one in the past. Windows' own tasks are listed by name only: their
# state changes while the two implementations run one after the other (CI run
# 39539586980: UsageDataReceiver went from Ready to Running).
get system information "tasks" into tasks
for each task in tasks
    say name of task
.
for each task in tasks
    if name of task starts with "Otter" or name of task starts with "otter"
        say name of task "|" state of task "|" lastRunTime of task "|" nextRunTime of task
    .
.
